    "Drop files from Finder onto a terminal pane to paste their paths. For panes on another machine, PNG, JPEG, GIF, and WebP images are first uploaded to ~/.cache/3rdr/drops on that machine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drop files from Finder onto a terminal pane to paste their paths. For panes on another machine, PNG, JPEG, GIF, and WebP images are first uploaded to ~/.cache/3rdr/drops on that machine."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finder からファイルをターミナルのペインにドロップすると、そのパスを貼り付けます。別のマシンのペインには、PNG、JPEG、GIF、WebP 画像を先にそのマシンの ~/.cache/3rdr/drops にアップロードします。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finder에서 파일을 터미널 pane에 끌어다 놓으면 경로를 붙여 넣습니다. 다른 머신의 pane에는 PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP 이미지를 그 머신의 ~/.cache/3rdr/drops에 먼저 올립니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each pane can have a browser of its own, which stays with the pane." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "pane ごとに専用のブラウザを開けます。ブラウザは pane を閉じるまで保たれます。"
