      }
    },
    "herdr shows notifications of its own only while herdr itself is open in a terminal app, never through hrdrhrdrhrdr. If you have it open there, you may get both: to keep only hrdrhrdrhrdr's, set delivery = \"off\" under [ui.toast] in herdr's config.toml. hrdrhrdrhrdr doesn't read or change herdr's settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "herdr shows notifications of its own only while herdr itself is open in a terminal app, never through hrdrhrdrhrdr. If you have it open there, you may get both: to keep only hrdrhrdrhrdr's, set delivery = \"off\" under [ui.toast] in herdr's config.toml. hrdrhrdrhrdr doesn't read or change herdr's settings."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "herdr 自身の通知は、ターミナルアプリで herdr を直接開いているときにだけ表示され、hrdrhrdrhrdr を通しては表示されません。そのように開いている場合は、両方の通知が届くことがあります。hrdrhrdrhrdr の通知だけにするには、herdr の config.toml の [ui.toast] に delivery = \"off\" を設定してください。hrdrhrdrhrdr は herdr の設定を読んだり変更したりしません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "herdr 자체 알림은 터미널 앱에서 herdr를 직접 열어 두었을 때만 나오며, hrdrhrdrhrdr를 통해서는 나오지 않습니다. 그렇게 열어 두었다면 두 알림을 모두 받을 수 있습니다. hrdrhrdrhrdr 알림만 받으려면 herdr의 config.toml에서 [ui.toast] 아래에 delivery = \"off\"를 설정하세요. hrdrhrdrhrdr는 herdr 설정을 읽거나 바꾸지 않습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
