          }
        }
      }
    },
    "hrdrhrdrhrdr watches the agents on all of your machines, the active one and the others, for as long as it is running — with its window closed, too. A pane you are looking at doesn't notify." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "hrdrhrdrhrdr watches the agents on all of your machines, the active one and the others, for as long as it is running — with its window closed, too. A pane you are looking at doesn't notify."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "hrdrhrdrhrdr は実行中、アクティブなマシンとほかのマシンすべての agent を見守ります。ウインドウを閉じていても同じです。いま表示している pane については通知しません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "hrdrhrdrhrdr는 실행되는 동안 활성 머신과 다른 머신 모두의 agent를 지켜봅니다. 창을 닫아도 마찬가지입니다. 지금 보고 있는 pane은 알리지 않습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
